# Everything that ends up inside a Linux container (mvnw, Dockerfiles,
# nginx.conf, SQL scripts) must keep LF line endings even on a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true — a CRLF shebang ("#!/bin/sh\r")
# makes the backend image build fail with "./mvnw: not found".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
